X:4
T:Charlie Mulvihill's Jig
T:Burke's
R:jig
S:Brendan Mulvihill
H:Brendan found the manuscript in a certain Charlie Mulvihill's attic (as part of Charlie's estate, not related, as I recall).  Brendan taught this tune at the 1993 Milwaukee summer school, and I transcribed it for the occasion of the Great IRTRAD 1994 Milwaukee Tune Swap.  Only some of the ornaments that Brendan taught us are included.
N:Cf. Bulmer \& Sharpley, "Burke's". Transcribed by Alan Ng
Z:Alan Ng's (alan@alan-ng.nospam (net)) contribution to Great '94 IRTRAD Milwaukee Tune Swap. id:ng-jigs-4
M:6/8
