X:11
T:Paddy's Return
T:Frost Is All Over, The
R:jig
S:as played by Planxty
N:Kevin Burke recorded this on Portland as Paddy's Return. Planxty's recording includes a single time through (vocal) the 1st part of the other tune called Frost Is All Over. Cf., Matt Cranitch's fiddle book, Sean Keane's 50 Fiddle Solos, Allan's Irish Fiddler, and Roche's.
D:The Planxty Collection, Shanachie 79012
Z:Transcribed by Alan Ng alan@alan-ng.nospam (net) July 9, 1996 id:ng-jigs-11
